---
/**
 * /terms — the Terms & Conditions.
 *
 * The SMS section is what A2P 10DLC registration is checked against, so it
 * states the program name, what the messages are, frequency, rates, STOP,
 * HELP, that consent is not a condition of purchase, and that carriers do not
 * guarantee delivery.
 *
 * TRANSACTIONAL ONLY, deliberately. This site collects one permission, for
 * messages about a quote the customer asked for. There is no marketing opt-in
 * anywhere in the codebase, so no promotional program is described here. If
 * marketing messages are ever added, they need their own consent, their own
 * disclosure version in sms-consent.ts, and their own section here.
 */
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { BUSINESS } from '../config/site';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Terms & Conditions"
  description="The terms for using the Load Logic Junk Removal website, including our text messaging program, quote requests, and service."
  updated="October 30, 2026"
>
  <p>
    These terms apply to this website and to the text messages we send about work you
    ask us to do. Using the site means you accept them. The site is operated by
    {' '}{BUSINESS.legalName}.
  </p>

  <h2>Quote requests and estimates</h2>
  <p>
    An estimate is based on what you tell us and on the photos you send. It is not a
    contract. The crew confirms the final price on site before anything is loaded, and
    you are free to decline at that point.
  </p>
  <p>
    Please send accurate details. Access, volume, and weight are what set the price, so
    anything we cannot see may change the estimate.
  </p>

  <h2>What we do not haul</h2>
  <p>
    Some materials are restricted by law or by the landfills and recyclers we use. If an
    item cannot be taken, we will tell you and, where we can, point you to the right
    place for it.
  </p>

  <h2>Text messaging program</h2>

  <h3>Program name</h3>
  <p>{BUSINESS.legalName}, operating as Load Logic Junk Removal.</p>

  <h3>What we send</h3>
  <p>
    Messages are transactional. They relate to a quote you requested, scheduling, the
    service itself, and customer care. We do not send promotional or marketing text
    messages through this program.
  </p>

  <h3>How you opt in</h3>
  <p>
    By ticking the text message checkbox on our quote form. The box is never checked for
    you. <strong>Consent is not a condition of purchase.</strong> You can request a quote
    and receive service without agreeing to texts, and you can call or text us directly
    instead.
  </p>

  <h3>Message frequency</h3>
  <p>Message frequency varies and depends on your request and the job.</p>

  <h3>Cost</h3>
  <p>Message and data rates may apply. Your mobile carrier sets those rates, not us.</p>

  <h3>How to opt out</h3>
  <p>
    Reply <strong>STOP</strong> to any message to stop receiving texts. We will send one
    confirmation and then stop. You can still call us, and you can opt back in by ticking
    the box again on a new request.
  </p>

  <h3>How to get help</h3>
  <p>
    Reply <strong>HELP</strong> for help, or contact us at
    {' '}<a href={`tel:${BUSINESS.phone}`}>{BUSINESS.phoneDisplay}</a> or
    {' '}<a href={`mailto:${BUSINESS.email}`}>{BUSINESS.email}</a>.
  </p>

  <h3>Delivery</h3>
  <p>
    Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages, and delivery is not
    guaranteed.
  </p>

  <h3>Your privacy</h3>
  <p>
    We do not sell your mobile information, and we do not share it with third parties or
    affiliates for their marketing purposes. See our
    {' '}<a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> for the detail.
  </p>

  <h2>Using this website</h2>
  <p>
    Please use the site for its purpose: learning what we do and asking for a quote. Do
    not submit other people's information, upload anything you do not have the right to
    send, or attempt to disrupt the site or its forms.
  </p>
  <p>
    The content, photographs, and branding on this site belong to us and may not be
    copied for commercial use without permission.
  </p>

  <h2>Accuracy</h2>
  <p>
    We keep pricing guidance, service areas, and equipment details current, but they can
    change. Nothing on this site is a guaranteed offer until we confirm it with you.
  </p>

  <h2>Liability</h2>
  <p>
    The website is provided as is. To the extent the law allows, we are not liable for
    losses arising from use of the site. This does not limit any rights you have under
    the terms of the service we actually perform for you.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>If these terms change, the date at the top of the page changes with them.</p>

  <h2>Contact us</h2>
  <p>
    {BUSINESS.legalName}<br />
    Phone: <a href={`tel:${BUSINESS.phone}`}>{BUSINESS.phoneDisplay}</a><br />
    Email: <a href={`mailto:${BUSINESS.email}`}>{BUSINESS.email}</a>
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
